1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,018
Where does a grasshopper hide its ears?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,950
Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:08,050
Are they on its legs, like Chirp? Nope!

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,167
Its ears are on its tummy!

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,000
But WHY on its tummy?

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,320
To hear other grasshoppers sing!

7
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,900
Many grasshoppers sing with their legs!

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,141
They rub a back leg on a wing!

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,916
And its back legs are like springs!

10
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,600
Look at it go!

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,750
A bug band!

12
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:27,701
The notes make a heart!

13
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,697
Six legs? In you go!

14
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:35,150
Play it again! Louder!

15
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:39,250
Oops! Too loud!

16
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,150
Where are YOUR ears?
